# About this game

- The user owns the design. Do not lock in theme, lore, factions, or systems unless they asked for that.
- Keep answers short.
- Free-to-play. No paid power (no pay-to-win, no purchasable stats/advantage).
- Age rating target is 12+ unless the user says otherwise.
- Use placeholder art until the user picks a visual theme.
- Built in Unity. Multiplayer/online. Design so cheating is hard.
- Trophies are used for matchmaking.
